        "source_line": 31,
        "source_header": "theorem exists_affine_bound_of_two_branch\n    (f : Nat → R) (left right : Nat → Nat) (n0 : Nat)\n    (rho K C D : R) (contract : rho < 1)\n    (sizes : ∀ n, n0 < n →\n      (left n : R) + (right n : R) ≤ rho * (n : R) + K)\n    (step : ∀ n, n0 < n →\n      f n ≤ f (left n) + f (right n) + C * (n : R) + D) :\n    ∃ A B : R, 0 ≤ A ∧ 0 ≤ B ∧ ∀ n : Nat, f n ≤ A * (n : R) + B",
        "source_header_sha256": "a1c9465fd6ebcd26339aa20ec95705cd0fe72d1d97cd6abe68b0d2efee36bc46",
